<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Subscription Cancelled - Blue Sky Outsourcing</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; }
        .email-container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #606c88 0%, #3f4c6b 100%); padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
        .icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .content { padding: 40px 30px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 18px; color: #333333; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .message { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #555555; margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .info-box { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 4px solid #606c88; }
        .info-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 8px 0; }
        .info-label { font-weight: 600; color: #333333; }
        .info-value { color: #555555; }
        .cta-button { display: inline-block; padding: 15px 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; margin: 10px 5px; }
        .secondary-button { display: inline-block; padding: 15px 40px; background-color: #ffffff; color: #667eea !important; text-decoration: none; border: 2px solid #667eea; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; margin: 10px 5px; }
        .footer { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: #777777; }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) { .content { padding: 30px 20px; } .cta-button, .secondary-button { display: block; margin: 10px 0; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="icon">👋</div>
            <h1>We're Sorry to See You Go</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">Hi <%= name %>,</div>
            
            <div class="message">
                Your <%= planName %> subscription has been cancelled due to extended non-payment.
            </div>
            
            <div class="info-box">
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: #333333;">Cancellation Details</h3>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Plan:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= planName %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Cancelled On:</span>
                    <span class="info-value"><%= cancellationDate %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row" style="border-bottom: none;">
                    <span class="info-label">Data Retention:</span>
                    <span class="info-value">30 days</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="message" style="background-color: #e3f2fd; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 4px solid #2196f3;">
                <strong>🛡️ Your Data:</strong> We'll keep your account data for 30 days. If you decide to return, all your information will be waiting for you.
            </div>
            
            <div class="message">
                <strong>You can resubscribe anytime:</strong>
                <ul style="color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;">
                    <li>All your previous data will be restored</li>
                    <li>Choose any plan that fits your needs</li>
                    <li>No setup required - pick up where you left off</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <a href="<%= resubscribeLink %>" class="cta-button">Resubscribe Now</a>
                <a href="<%= plansLink %>" class="secondary-button">View All Plans</a>
            </div>
            
            <div class="message" style="background-color: #fff3e0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px;">
                <strong>💬 We'd Love Your Feedback</strong>
                <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; color: #555555;">
                    Could you take a moment to tell us why you left? Your feedback helps us improve our service.
                </p>
                <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 15px;">
                    <a href="<%= feedbackLink %>" style="color: #667eea; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">Share Feedback →</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="message" style="font-size: 14px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; padding-top: 20px;">
                Thank you for being part of Blue Sky Outsourcing. We hope to see you again soon!
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p><strong>Blue Sky Outsourcing</strong></p>
            <p>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Blue Sky Outsourcing. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>
                <a href="<%= process.env.APP_URL %>/contact" style="color: #667eea;">Contact Support</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

